  "entry": "code/app.py",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Fit the MAK2 mechanistic PCR model to each well's fluorescence-vs-cycle curve to estimate the initial template amount (D0) without a standard curve, as a route to absolute quantification. Then check replicate precision and dilution-series linearity and export the batch results. A Copy Number Conversion option is visible in the sidebar but was not exercised in this run. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
